 (RESERVED INFRA; adversarial_verify hardening -- TWO reader-side guards) --
 (1) an INTRINSIC-REWARD-WITHOUT-DOWNSTREAM-GAIN overclaim guard: an ARC
 artifact claiming a curiosity/exploration/ learning-progress win MUST report
 a measured DOWNSTREAM metric (live solve-rate / coverage / first-win), not
 substitute a rising intrinsic-bonus magnitude (the A1 failure mode the bare
 control + FALSE_NEGATIVE_RISK guards); (2) a SELF-SUPERVISED-CNN substrate
